  "problem": "Using the cumulative distribution function table of the binomial random variable $X∼B(7,0.48)$ given below, compute $P(X>5).$\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ | $7$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $P(X\\le x)$ | $\\,0.0103\\,$ | $\\,0.0767\\,$ | $\\,0.2607\\,$ | $\\,0.5437\\,$ | $\\,0.8049\\,$ | $\\,0.9496\\,$ | $\\,0.9941\\,$ | $\\,1.0000\\,$ |\n\n$P(X>5)=$\n{{field-1}}",
